  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of its cramped and inadequate internal space and lack of supporting information to demonstrate the proposed new flats would receive adequate daylight and sunlight, would fail to provide an acceptable standard of accommodation for future occupiers, contrary to Local Plan policies SC5 and SC6 and London Plan policy D6.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that the proposal would not result in harm to highway and pedestrian safety, contrary to Local Plan Policy EC2 (Developing a Sustainable Local Transport Network) and the Residential Crossovers and Off-Street Parking Policy."
